1
00:00:00,767 --> 00:00:02,033
- [JUNE] Hey!
- [PING GRUNTS]

2
00:00:02,767 --> 00:00:04,200
- [PING GRUNTS]
- Ow!

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,000
What's with you, huh?!

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,733
Why do you have a copy of
our birth certificates?

5
00:00:08,733 --> 00:00:11,567
I wanted to check if you're
really related to Don Nato.

6
00:00:11,567 --> 00:00:13,433
Why are you dragging Ima
into all of this?

7
00:00:13,433 --> 00:00:15,267
If you have a problem
with me,

8
00:00:15,267 --> 00:00:17,600
- leave her out of it.
- Okay.

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,467
Fine. Listen.

10
00:00:19,467 --> 00:00:21,300
I checked your social
media accounts

11
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,400
and there's no record of
you being in a relationship.

12
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,633
You said it yourself, right?

13
00:00:25,633 --> 00:00:27,400
Why are you acting
like this now?

14
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:29,700
You seem eager
to get married.

15
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,967
Are you that
desperate for money?

16
00:00:33,133 --> 00:00:35,433
Just so you know,

17
00:00:35,467 --> 00:00:37,400
everyone is desperate
for money.

18
00:00:38,267 --> 00:00:40,767
Why should I be ashamed
of my dream

19
00:00:40,767 --> 00:00:44,267
to give Ima and my family
a better life?

20
00:00:44,267 --> 00:00:46,533
I'm willing to do anything.

21
00:00:46,533 --> 00:00:49,067
We don't stop working...

22
00:00:49,767 --> 00:00:53,333
but it's still hard for us
to make both ends meet.

23
00:00:53,333 --> 00:00:55,600
We're not rich
like you.

24
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:59,400
You don't understand how
hard it is to be poor.

25
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:02,367
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

26
00:01:02,367 --> 00:01:04,233
You think I came
from money?

27
00:01:05,367 --> 00:01:06,733
Well, listen.

28
00:01:07,667 --> 00:01:09,100
My father...

29
00:01:09,733 --> 00:01:11,533
was Don Nato's driver.

30
00:01:12,533 --> 00:01:14,567
He treated us like family...

31
00:01:15,533 --> 00:01:17,833
and he helped us grow
our business.

32
00:01:17,833 --> 00:01:19,533
Everything I have now...

33
00:01:20,267 --> 00:01:21,800
I owe it all to him.

34
00:01:22,767 --> 00:01:26,300
So I'm sorry if you're upset
at what I'm doing.

35
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:30,133
But I will protect everything
Don Nato worked hard for.

36
00:01:31,533 --> 00:01:32,667
Well, sorry.

37
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:34,833
I thought you were
born rich.

38
00:01:34,833 --> 00:01:36,600
That's the problem
with you.

39
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:37,800
You think you know me.

40
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:39,633
Wow! That's rich
coming from you.

41
00:01:39,633 --> 00:01:42,633
You already judged me
the first time we met.

42
00:01:42,667 --> 00:01:44,700
If you think about it,

43
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:47,400
we're both doing this
for our families.

44
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:50,467
I'm doing this for Ima, and
you're doing this for Don Nato.

45
00:01:50,467 --> 00:01:51,833
Right?

46
00:01:51,833 --> 00:01:57,700
[MOROSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

47
00:01:57,700 --> 00:01:59,433
Hey!

48
00:01:59,433 --> 00:02:03,133
Hey! Why do you always pick
fights with me?

49
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:08,167
OMG!

50
00:02:09,100 --> 00:02:10,767
Our first lovers' quarrel!

51
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:16,700
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

52
00:02:16,733 --> 00:02:19,300
You know, it'd be good if I
could put you on mute.

53
00:02:19,900 --> 00:02:22,633
I wish you were
just a standee.

54
00:02:22,633 --> 00:02:28,133
[QUIRKY MUSIC CONTINUES]

55
00:02:28,133 --> 00:02:29,567
You find me pretty,
don't you?

56
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:36,567
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

57
00:02:38,267 --> 00:02:39,800
What a snob.

58
00:02:43,567 --> 00:02:45,167
Plan B.

59
00:02:46,667 --> 00:02:49,633
Shower Papa Ping with lots
of affection.
